      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5694e28a514928909c7ad94a0f61599e3fe985c4e2aca4587fea6bbff6d393b2",
        "slc_d78e4123de1bf422073e33fd66277fcc63573055d44f84f939492da71ebefb88"
      ],
      "text": "The product hooks into 12 agent harnesses in two classes: ten coding CLIs (e.g. Claude Code, Codex) and two chat/assistant gateways (Hermes, OpenClaw), with the same events and policies across them."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3cb98631c03fcb2b1556c1b93a2bedd6f431f8d5d2155750a63a3c55fd15c637",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "86f80fc59ee1a18211780ef2fe964d80858deeb2",
          "git_sha": "636d2666bd3f24622e247b3b741143aed0c0ac72",
          "line_end": 39,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "failproofai/failproofai",
          "url": "https://github.com/FailproofAI/failproofai/blob/86f80fc59ee1a18211780ef2fe964d80858deeb2/README.md#L37-L39"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ffc82a323ccda94a09e2bf4de79f3c484f0a4aa0cf3cfa45a3be70c276c854f4"
      ],
      "text": "Agents outside supported harnesses can report via a Python SDK providing tracing, sessions and audits; enforcement there requires a hook in the user's own runtime."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b4e41cdc9b7c5ad3fc9cd74329ca984b9a373e5a4e8289930c5c3be5ef864de0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "86f80fc59ee1a18211780ef2fe964d80858deeb2",
          "git_sha": "636d2666bd3f24622e247b3b741143aed0c0ac72",
          "line_end": 192,
          "line_start": 188,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "failproofai/failproofai",
          "url": "https://github.com/FailproofAI/failproofai/blob/86f80fc59ee1a18211780ef2fe964d80858deeb2/README.md#L188-L192"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_05a6dcae50487e0d8ac0f9df485a3d449df1697dbb77e1342f99b9b1bf2190a9"
      ],
      "text": "Policies return one of three decisions: allow() permits the operation, deny(message) blocks it and returns the message to the agent, and instruct(message) lets it pass while adding context to the agent's next prompt."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_82581b1582d7667b196012cb16fa81d864344db38de083cb8979b582a32eb87b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
