        "slc_d572900a490b29de2be9aaa247d73a570969cec5cc161ef710424fbbf465a09e"
      ],
      "text": "The package is distributed via npm as failproofai and installed globally with npm install -g; the project is written in TypeScript per its Trendshift badge."
    },
